<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait T-bill balance grows.</title>
<headline>Kuwait T-bill balance grows.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding balance of treasury bills issued by Kuwait's Central Bank rose to 1.327 billion dinars at the end of February from 809 million in the same period of 1996, a Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>They were unchanged compared to January 1997.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance of public debt instruments -- bonds and bills -- edged down to 2.495 billion dinars at the end of February from 2.497 billion at the end of January.</p>
<p>The balance of public debt instruments was 2.852 billion in February 1996.</p>
<p>				 Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				 Feb '97		 Feb '96</p>
<p>Bills</p>
<p>  Matured		     192.3		    43.2</p>
<p>  New Issue		   190.0		    60.0</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,168.3		 2,043.2</p>
<p>Bonds</p>
<p>  Matured			 --			--</p>
<p>  New Issue		     --			--</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,327.0		   809.2</p>
<p>Slight discrepancies in figures are due to rounding.</p>
